{
  "assessments": [
    {
      "deviation_ids": [],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "claim": "_public_use_case 装饰器统一捕获所有领域异常并转化为 ApplicationCoordinatorError；是单一应用入口的机械保障",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L225-L303"
        },
        {
          "claim": "_exclusive_effect_lock 使用平台锁（msvcrt/fcntl）串行化可恢复事务",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L136-L169"
        },
        {
          "claim": "confirm_project_authorities 原子事务：校验 bundle SHA、decisions 顺序、候选未变化；apply_project_authority_confirmation_transaction；失败时 restore_yaml_patch_originals",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L823-L1147"
        },
        {
          "claim": "project_authority_candidate 完整实现：验证 ready_for_confirmation 状态、validate_authority_change_targets 身份核对、_validated_upstream_authority_refs 上游绑定，返回包含 content_sha256 和 governed_paths 的候选结构",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/project_authority_decision.py#L786-L826"
        },
        {
          "claim": "build_project_authority_confirmation_transaction 构建可恢复 YAML 补丁事务：逐项验证候选未变化、不允许 immutable ref 写入、更新 baseline authority_refs 状态和 review_state；调用 build_yaml_patch_transaction 生成多路径原子更新",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/project_authority_decision.py#L831-L996"
        },
        {
          "claim": "validate_project_authority_decision 通过 reproduce_confirmation_record 核验负责人确认原文不可伪造，再通过 confirmed_project_authority_snapshot 验证正文字节与确认哈希匹配",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/project_authority_decision.py#L1102-L1176"
        },
        {
          "claim": "ImplementationAlignmentArtifactStore._store_value 实现内容寻址分层分页（list_segments/map_pages），PAGE_TARGET_BYTES=512KB、MAX_CHUNK_BYTES=8MB、MAX_PAGE_ITEMS=256；_write_content 通过 tempfile+fsync+os.replace 保证写入原子性",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_artifacts.py#L62-L212"
        },
        {
          "claim": "garbage_collect_orphan_components 从 preparations/captures 清单遍历所有可达组件，仅删除孤立组件（unreachable from any manifest）；apply 时需 expected_orphan_set_sha256 与 dry-run 结果一致",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_artifacts.py#L580-L671"
        },
        {
          "claim": "ImplementationAlignmentPreparation._binding() 解析当前已确认方案和唯一 domain_alignment 操作、implementation_root；_documents() 读取或初始化对齐草稿文档集，区分首次与修订",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_preparation.py#L558-L743"
        },
        {
          "claim": "inspect() 实现有界逻辑记录分页：_inspection_cursor 基于 content_sha256+offset 生成 SHA256 签名游标，_inspection_offset 验证游标归属，page=items[offset:offset+limit] 分页返回，next_cursor 在未到末尾时生成，向调用方隐藏存储布局",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_preparation.py#L1505-L1551"
        },
        {
          "claim": "write_candidate() 实现持久事务日志写入：_decision_values 校验决定引用和字段精确匹配，_assert_target_file_bindings 写入前验证六文件未变，_atomic_dump_many 形成恢复性写入，validate_replaced 写后完整结构复核（包含 ProjectImplementationAlignment.load() 和 current_binding_check），complete_alignment 从 observation/unresolved/deviations/source/dependencies/responsibilities 综合判断",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_preparation.py#L1971-L2362"
        },
        {
          "claim": "capture_external() 要求 authorize_external=True 显式授权，校验 provider_plans 非空，调用 observe_project_implementation(external_execution_authorized=True)，存储 capture 后更新准备包引用和决定目录",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_alignment_preparation.py#L1794-L1870"
        },
        {
          "claim": "ImplementationCandidateEvidence 实现操作实现度比对（operation_realization 比对 base/current 字节差异）、文件快照（path_snapshot 计算 SHA256）、已完成切片保护（require_completed_slice_snapshots 拒绝后续工作改写已完成切片）、候选快照（candidate_snapshot 绑定 plan_id/base_commit/实施路径/语义未证明标记）、冲突解决候选（conflict_candidate_snapshot 验证非冲突路径未变、冲突路径在已确认范围内）",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/implementation_candidate_evidence.py#L36-L716"
        },
        {
          "claim": "verify 方法完整实现：run/not_run/assess 三模式，implementing 时校验切片路径和上游权威，检测 pending_effect 恢复验证，conflict 时强制 target 执行区域",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L2441-L2715"
        },
        {
          "claim": "cancel 方法完整实现：reason 开始取消+decision 处置（preserve/transfer/discard），discard 时 claim_external_effect 后 cleanup 各仓库，has_unmerged_work 时进入 cancelled_changes_pending",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L2878-L2990"
        },
        {
          "claim": "complete_implementation_slice 校验切片无验证命令、路径范围、上游权威、操作实现度，构造 explicit_no_command 完成记录",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L3184-L3293"
        },
        {
          "claim": "confirm 方法按 direction/engineering_plan/actual_result 路由，actual_result 确认时校验 require_implementation_candidate_snapshot 和 verify_working_tree_candidate_snapshot",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L3456-L3606"
        },
        {
          "claim": "request_replan 校验 schema_version 和 reasons 字段，委托 authority.transition request_replan",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/application_coordinator.py#L3295-L3327"
        },
        {
          "claim": "install_agent_skill 幂等安装 packaged skill，不修改 Agent 配置",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/agent_setup.py#L1-L129"
        },
        {
          "claim": "纯指导文档，描述行为示例规范、验证安排和报告要求；明确声明 'the program checks structure and references' 不决定适用性和充分性",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/resources/agent-skill/strixnova/references/behavior-examples.md#L1-L127"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "implementation_alignment_preparation.py 中 _atomic_dump_many 和 _recover_transactions 的文件事务恢复细节依赖 DocumentTransactionError 异常路径，未静态验证所有 OS 故障场景下的恢复完备性",
        "代码静态阅读不证明 Agent 语义效果、Git 绑定采用或真实负责人接受",
        "recorded_executions 的 source_at_execution_hash 注明 'do not infer exact-byte coverage from outcome alone'，测试通过仅为结构性辅助证据"
      ],
      "missing": [],
      "resolution_plan": [],
      "satisfied": [
        "单一应用入口：ApplicationCoordinator 是所有状态变更用例的唯一入口；_public_use_case 装饰器统一捕获领域异常并转化为 ApplicationCoordinatorError",
        "可恢复执行序列化：_exclusive_effect_lock 使用 msvcrt.locking/fcntl.flock 对每个 WorkItem 的可变效果操作串行化，_claim_external_effect 记录 pending_effect 意图，在 confirm_project_authorities 的 recovering_confirmation 路径下完整实现意图恢复",
        "执行目标权威用例：project_authority_candidate（从 project_authority_decision.py 导入，验证 ready_for_confirmation 状态、change_set 精确性、上游绑定）、review_project_authorities（记录八视角复核后的 candidate_bundle 哈希）、confirm_project_authorities（原子校验 bundle SHA、decisions 顺序、候选未变化，调用 build_project_authority_confirmation_transaction + apply_project_authority_confirmation_transaction，失败时 restore_yaml_patch_originals）",
        "目标权威事务实现（project_authority_decision.py 全文直接读取）：project_authority_candidate 完整实现（L786-L826）包含 validate_authority_change_targets 身份核对；build_project_authority_confirmation_transaction 构建可恢复 YAML 补丁事务（L831-L996）；apply_project_authority_confirmation_transaction 幂等应用（L999-L1012）；confirmed_project_authority_snapshot 重新读取已确认内容并验证基线采用状态（L1015-L1099）；validate_project_authority_decision 通过 reproduce_confirmation_record 核验负责人确认原文（L1102-L1176）",
        "执行对齐复核用例完整覆盖（implementation_alignment_preparation.py 2362行全文直接读取）：prepare()（L1650-1792）从 _binding() 解析当前已确认方案和实施切片、观察源码、存储准备包；inspect()（L1505-1551）实现有界逻辑记录分页和不透明游标（_inspection_cursor 基于 SHA256 签名、_inspection_offset 验证、page slice 分页返回 items 和 next_cursor），每页限 1-200 条目；write_candidate()（L1971-2362）实现持久事务日志写入对齐草稿，包含 _decision_values 校验决定完整性、_assert_target_file_bindings 验证六文件字节未变化、通过 _atomic_dump_many 形成恢复性事务写入文档集并在写入后通过 validate_replaced 做完整结构复核，最后计算 complete_alignment 状态；capture_external()（L1794-1870）要求 authorize_external=True 显式授权、校验 provider 计划存在、执行外部观察后存储 capture 并更新准备包引用",
        "ImplementationCandidateEvidence（implementation_candidate_evidence.py 716行全文直接读取）：实现操作实现度比对（operation_realization 比对 base/current 字节差异）、实施切片文件快照（path_snapshot 计算 SHA256）、已完成切片保护（require_completed_slice_snapshots 拒绝后续工作改写已完成切片）、候选快照（candidate_snapshot 绑定 plan_id/base_commit/实施路径/语义未证明标记）、冲突解决候选（conflict_candidate_snapshot 验证非冲突路径未变、冲突路径在已确认范围内），直接支撑 present_actual_result 和 delivery 用例中的文件完整性校验",
        "verify（L2441-2715）：_public_use_case 装饰，按 run/not_run/assess 三模式路由，implementing 状态下校验切片路径范围和上游权威决定、检测 pending_effect 恢复验证、conflict 状态要求先记录冲突解决；cancel（L2878-2990）：_public_use_case 装饰，支持 reason 开始取消、decision 决策（preserve/transfer/discard），在 discard 时 claim_external_effect 后调用 _cleanup_cancellation_repositories 清理各仓库工作区",
        "complete_implementation_slice（L3184-3293）：_public_use_case 装饰，验证切片无验证命令、校验切片路径范围和上游权威决定、调用 _require_slice_operations_realized 确认操作已实现、构造 explicit_no_command 完成记录并写入",
        "request_replan（L3295-3327）：_public_use_case 装饰，校验 schema_version 和 reasons 字段，委托 authority.transition request_replan",
        "confirm（L3456-3606）：_public_use_case 装饰，按 direction/engineering_plan/actual_result 三种确认类型路由，校验 current_action 匹配后调用 confirmation_record_from_input 处理挑战应答，actual_result 确认时额外校验 require_implementation_candidate_snapshot 和 verify_working_tree_candidate_snapshot",
        "install_agent_guidance：委托 install_agent_skill 幂等安装 packaged skill，不修改 Agent 配置（agent_setup.py 全文确认）",
        "behavior-examples.md（全文读取，127行）：纯指导文档，描述行为示例规范、验证安排和报告要求；明确声明 semantic_content_machine_proven=false 且 program 仅检查结构和引用，不决定适用性和充分性"
      ],
      "status": "implemented",
      "target_id": "MODULE-159AE7957218470C",
      "target_kind": "module"
    },
    {
      "deviation_ids": [],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "claim": "validate_assessment 公开函数签名，文档说明不添加语义的校验职责",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L1647-L1661"
        },
        {
          "claim": "validate_assessment 在检测到任何 issues 时抛出 EngineeringGovernanceError(issues)，issues 列表即结构化缺口输出",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L3028-L3030"
        },
        {
          "claim": "compile_engineering_plan 签名与文档，调用 validate_assessment 后投影完整工程方案",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L3398-L3412"
        },
        {
          "claim": "investigation_ref 从可信代码事实派生不可变调查提交引用：L1792-1793 从 code_facts 获取 investigation fact，L1796-1801 校验请求引用与事实匹配，L1802-1804 传播 fact issues，L1805-1809 仅当 immutable=True 时设置 investigation_commit=resolved_ref",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L1788-L1809"
        },
        {
          "claim": "操作文件存在性校验条件：L2292 'if investigation_commit is not None' 使此校验仅在拥有不可变提交时触发；L2299-2323 逐操作按 code_facts 校验 create 文件不存在、modify/delete/move 文件必须存在、move 目标不存在",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L2292-L2339"
        },
        {
          "claim": "L2340-2341 非正式调查不允许任何仓库操作：'if not formal and operations: issues.append(\"非正式调查不得计划仓库创建、修改、删除或移动操作\")'——因此文件存在性校验豁免不造成安全缺口",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L2340-L2341"
        },
        {
          "claim": "impact_scope 缺少任何维度时追加错误，完整覆盖 IMPACT_DIMENSIONS",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L1986-L1992"
        },
        {
          "claim": "_validate_bindings 要求精确匹配五权威链及治理档案，evidence_base_commit 须为观察版本祖先",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/project_engineering_assurance.py#L231-L258"
        },
        {
          "claim": "_validate_rule_assessments 逐条校验规则来源绑定、证据引用、状态与缺口纠偏约束",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/project_engineering_assurance.py#L335-L396"
        },
        {
          "claim": "example_catalog 维护例子到验收的父子关系，basis_refs 仅允许本验收需求或约束",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/behavior_examples.py#L84-L119"
        },
        {
          "claim": "validate_reviews 检查核验安排方式、目标覆盖、证据引用约束",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/verification_targets.py#L40-L65"
        },
        {
          "claim": "编制方案时明确输出 semantic_content_machine_proven=False，不伪造语义证明",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L3584-L3584"
        },
        {
          "claim": "_validate_domain_fact_authority_change_alignment 确保 domain_fact_changes 与 authority_change_set 中 Fact 身份与动作一致",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L1059-L1108"
        },
        {
          "claim": "create_project 场景强制要求六个权威路径字段及工程方法采用状态明确声明",
          "kind": "source",
          "ref": "inputs/files/strixnova/src/strixnova/engineering_governance.py#L1844-L1863"
        },
        {
          "claim": "recorded_executions 中 test_example_basis_is_owned_by_its_acceptance_not_the_implementation 两次 run_id 均 passed",
          "kind": "test",
          "ref": "inputs/packet.json#L485-L485"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "外部保障回执真实性属于人类语义范畴，不是程序可以自行认证的范围；合同明确排除此责任（not_responsible_for），因此不属于代码缺口",
        "_rule_results 的触发完整性取决于调用方提供的 applicable_rules 输入，模块本身按输入列表逐条校验；无法从源码静态证明调用方是否提供了全部适用规则",
        "代码静态阅读不证明 Agent 语义效果、Git 绑定采用或真实负责人接受",
        "recorded_executions 的 source_at_execution_hash 注明 'do not infer exact-byte coverage from outcome alone'，测试通过仅为结构性辅助证据"
      ],
      "missing": [],
      "resolution_plan": [],
      "satisfied": [
        "validate_assessment 函数实现对工程评估候选的结构与字段校验，包含 schema_version、assessment_id、direction_ref、investigation_ref、change_context、impact_scope 等必填字段校验（engineering_governance.py L1647-3030）",
        "compile_engineering_plan 函数将已校验评估投影为规范化工程方案，包含 authority_change_set、implementation_slices、verification_commands、verification_targets、behavior_examples、owner_view、applicable_rules、assurance_band 等关键字段（engineering_governance.py L3398-3585）",
        "合同操作'解释确定性缺口'通过 EngineeringGovernanceError/ChangePlanningError 抛出 issues 列表实现：validate_assessment 和 compile_engineering_plan 在校验失败时返回结构化错误列表（issues 字段），调用方可直接读取缺口说明，不需要独立同名函数",
        "合同'停止条件'通过 implementation_slices 结构（含切片依赖图）和 verification_commands 组合体现：focused_slice 和 implementation_slice_reportability 从方案投影当前切片状态，terminal_slice_issue 判定停止边界；方案字段本身就是停止条件的表达形式",
        "impact_scope 的全部规定维度完整覆盖校验（engineering_governance.py L1986-1992）",
        "create_project 场景强制要求六个权威路径字段及工程方法采用状态明确声明（engineering_governance.py L1844-1863，L1519-1530）",
        "engineering_change_planning.py 实现 validate_change_planning（权威变更集结构与身份校验）、compile_implementation_slices（切片依赖与操作绑定）、validate_semantic_review（语义复核声明校验）",
        "project_engineering_assurance.py 实现 ProjectEngineeringAssurance 类，含 load/matrix 方法，校验规则来源绑定、证据路径内容摘要、权威与治理档案精确绑定、外部保障回执约束",
        "behavior_examples.py 实现 normalize_behavior、example_catalog、example_ids、example_parents，正确维护例子与验收的父子关系和 basis_refs 约束",
